msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Yasuko「......Hey Ryuu-chan, what are \"sunlight＿rights\"?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「......Oye, Ryuu-chan, ¿qué es＿eso del \"derecho al sol\"?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......I don't exactly know, but there's＿plenty to be gained when it's sunny,＿right?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......No lo sé con exactitud, pero se＿gana mucho cuando hay sol, ¿no?」"

msgid "Yasuko「For exampleee?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Por ejemplooo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Mold doesn't grow easily, laundry dries＿faster, and it's just plain nice.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No sale moho tan fácil, la ropa seca más＿rápido y simplemente es agradable.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Oh, reallyyy? You're right. So righttt.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Ah, ¿en seriooo? Tienes＿razón. Mucha razónnn.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「So apparently everyone has a right to＿those benefits. In short, ours have＿been violated.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Así que al parecer todos tienen derecho＿a esos beneficios. En resumen, han＿violado los nuestros.」"

msgid "Yasuko「But then Taiga-chan would never have＿come overrr. That'd be saddd.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Pero entonces Taiga-chan nunca habría＿venidooo. Eso sería tristeee.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......You're right.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Tienes razón.」"

msgid "Yasuko「............」"
msgstr "Yasuko「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Both「*Sigh*～」"
msgstr "Ambos「*Suspiro*～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「--April--」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「--Abril--」"

msgid "Taiga「I've decided to move away.」"
msgstr "Taiga「He decidido mudarme lejos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「After the fire, we hadn't seen Taiga for＿some time. When she finally turned up,＿that was the first thing she said.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tras el incendio, pasamos un tiempo＿sin ver a Taiga. Cuando al fin apareció,＿eso fue lo primero que dijo.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Whaaat～!?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¡¿Quééé～?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「M-Move where?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿M-Mudarte a dónde?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Huh? What? Where's she live?＿You'll still be at school, right?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Eh? ¿Qué? ¿Dónde vive? Seguirás＿yendo a la escuela, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Taiga「It's too far away, so I've decided to quit.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Está demasiado lejos, así＿que decidí dejarla.」"

msgid "Yasuko「......Huh? What? But WHY would that＿make Taiga-chan move awayyy?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「......¿Eh? ¿Qué? ¿Pero POR QUÉ eso＿haría que Taiga-chan se mudaraaa?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wha-- are you serious!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Qu-- hablas en serio?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「When I responded, \"None of that is＿your fault,\" Taiga forced a thin smile.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Cuando le respondí: \"Nada de＿eso es culpa tuya\", Taiga forzó＿una leve sonrisa.」"

msgid "Taiga「Well then, Ryuuji, Yacchan...... Thank＿you for everything.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Bueno, entonces, Ryuuji, Yacchan......＿Gracias por todo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「With those admirable words, she＿bowed and turned to leave.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Con esas admirables palabras, hizo una＿reverencia y se giró para marcharse.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh? T-This is me......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh? S-Soy yo......」"

msgid "Taiga「No! Not literally! Paraphrase!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡No! ¡No literalmente! ¡Parafrasea!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......This is Taiga acting of her own＿volition.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Es Taiga actuando por＿su propia voluntad.」"

msgid "Taiga「Good job.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Bien hecho.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pero......」"

msgid "Taiga「Shut up! Be quiet! Zip those lips!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Cállate! ¡Silencio! ¡Cierra esa boca!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......」"

msgid "Taiga「I'm done training you now, so engrave＿it in your mind!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ya terminé de entrenarte, ¡así＿que grábatelo en la mente!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You're done? You call that training?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Ya terminaste? ¿A eso le＿llamas entrenamiento?」"

msgid "Taiga「......See ya.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Nos vemos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「--And so, she completely disappeared＿from our sight.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「--Y así, desapareció por completo＿de nuestra vista.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Hey Ryuu-chan, that girl......」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Oye, Ryuu-chan, esa chica......」"

msgid "Yasuko「......Yacchan gets the feeling that girl＿was claiming to be Taiga-chan's＿frienddd.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「......A Yacchan le da la sensación＿de que esa chica decía ser amigaaa＿de Taiga-chan.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, you're right.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, tienes razón.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Is she Ryuu-chan's friend too?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿También es amiga de Ryuu-chan?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......She was once my classmate.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Una vez fue mi compañera de clase.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Hey, you think that girl might have＿Taiga-chan's contact infooo?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Oye, ¿crees que esa chica tenga＿el contacto de Taiga-channn?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Well, we can only wait for her to get＿in touch with us.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Bueno, solo nos queda esperar a＿que se ponga en contacto con nosotros.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Nnnn～ Well, yeah, buuut～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Nnnn～ Bueno, sí, perooo～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「We had no choice in any of this......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No tuvimos opción en nada de esto......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「The distant uniformed figure turned,＿and by chance, our eyes met.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「La lejana figura en uniforme se＿giró y, por casualidad, nuestras＿miradas se cruzaron.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「There was no trace of even the＿slightest ripple in the waters of my＿heart......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No había rastro de ni la más mínima onda＿en las aguas de mi corazón......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「When I broke off my cold gaze, the girl＿I once loved so deeply inclined her＿head slightly and turned away.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Al apartar mi fría mirada, la chica a＿la que una vez amé tanto inclinó un poco＿la cabeza y se dio la vuelta.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「In the renewed tranquility of our home,＿the fierce spring sunbeams dance＿brightly today, too.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「En la renovada calma de nuestro hogar,＿los intensos rayos del sol primaveral＿danzan alegres hoy también.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Right as I wished I'd dried the futons,＿behind me in the living room,＿Inko-chan coughed like an old-timer.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Justo cuando deseaba haber aireado los＿futones, detrás de mí, en la sala,＿Inko-chan tosió como un anciano.」"

msgid "Yuri「Hello. First of all, perhaps I should＿thank you for your hard work,＿Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Hola. Antes que nada, quizá debería＿agradecerte por tu esfuerzo, Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Yuri「Now that you got this ending, the＿reason I brought you here......」"
msgstr "Yuri「Ahora que llegaste a este final, la＿razón por la que te traje aquí......」"

msgid "Yuri「......is none other than to discuss the＿route you chose. I thought we could＿ponder it together.」"
msgstr "Yuri「......no es otra que hablar sobre la＿ruta que elegiste. Pensé que podríamos＿reflexionar juntos al respecto.」"

msgid "Yuri「Well then, let's evaluate the ending you＿just saw.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bien, entonces evaluemos el＿final que acabas de ver.」"

msgid "Yuri「Welcome, Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bienvenido, Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Yuri「Well then, let's begin to evaluate the＿ending you just saw.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bien, comencemos a evaluar el＿final que acabas de ver.」"

msgid "Yuri「Hmmm～...... This is quite the＿unfortunate ending somehow.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Hmmm～...... De algún modo, este es＿un final bastante desafortunado.」"

msgid "Yuri「That's all the advice I have for you.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Ese es todo el consejo＿que tengo para ti.」"

msgid "Yuri「If I were to grade this ending, I guess＿I'd give it 65 points. Let's work just a＿little bit harder!」"
msgstr "Yuri「Si calificara este final, supongo＿que le daría 65 puntos. ¡Esforcémonos＿un poco más!」"

msgid "Yuri「Okay, that's all for today. Until next＿time!」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bueno, eso es todo por hoy.＿¡Hasta la próxima!」"

msgid "『Music』 is now available in 『Extra』"
msgstr "『Música』 ya está disponible en 『Extra』"

msgid "『Album』 is now available in 『Extra』"
msgstr "『Álbum』 ya está disponible en 『Extra』"

msgid "Yasuko「Ohhh～ Come to think of it, before＿those condos next door were built, the＿landlady was saying something about」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Ohhh～ Ahora que lo pienso, antes de que＿hicieran esos departamentos de al lado,＿la casera decía algo sobre」"

msgid "Yasuko「it... or was she...?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「eso... ¿o no lo decía...?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Well, if the local residents had been＿more firmly opposed to it, those＿super-modern condos would never」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Bueno, si los vecinos se hubieran＿opuesto con más firmeza, esos＿departamentos súper modernos nunca se」"

msgid "Ryuuji「have been built.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「habrían construido.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「After two years, demolition began on＿the massive modern condos that＿blocked sunlight from our house. Soon」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tras dos años, comenzó la demolición de＿los enormes departamentos modernos que＿tapaban el sol de nuestra casa. Pronto」"

msgid "Ryuuji「there'd be nothing left but the vacant＿lot from before.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「no quedaría nada más que el＿terreno baldío de antes.」"

msgid "Taiga「Mama's getting remarried and she＿invited me to live with her. We've been＿talking about it for a while, but I've」"
msgstr "Taiga「Mamá se va a volver a casar y me invitó＿a vivir con ella. Llevábamos tiempo＿hablándolo, pero al fin me he」"

msgid "Taiga「finally decided.」"
msgstr "Taiga「decidido.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wha......? Huh? But what about the＿condo? The fire didn't get out of＿control. It's not like it's uninhabitable,」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué......? ¿Eh? ¿Y el departamento?＿El incendio no se salió de control. No＿es que haya quedado inhabitable,」"

msgid "Ryuuji「right?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿verdad?」"

msgid "Taiga「Well, ever since the fire it seems like＿it's been jinxed. Its market value is＿being questioned, so residents are」"
msgstr "Taiga「Bueno, desde el incendio parece que está＿maldito. Se cuestiona su valor de＿mercado, así que los inquilinos se」"

msgid "Taiga「leaving left and right.」"
msgstr "Taiga「marchan por montones.」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh, the story doesn't end there. The＿original management company＿collapsed straight away. And then they」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ah, la historia no termina ahí. La＿empresa administradora original quebró＿de inmediato. Y luego」"

msgid "Taiga「found out that the architecture is in＿HUGE violation of some kind of law,＿apparently.」"
msgstr "Taiga「descubrieron que la estructura viola＿GRAVEMENTE alguna ley, según parece.」"

msgid "Taiga「On top of all that, the issue of sunlight＿rights was readdressed, so I guess＿they just decided \"screw it, let's take it」"
msgstr "Taiga「Encima de todo, se retomó el tema del＿derecho al sol, así que supongo que＿dijeron \"al diablo, vamos a」"

msgid "Taiga「down.\"」"
msgstr "Taiga「demolerlo\".」"

msgid "Taiga「I'm not really sure. That's what Mama＿was saying. In a way it feels like I was＿responsible for this domino effect.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No estoy muy segura. Eso decía Mamá.＿En cierto modo, siento que yo provoqué＿este efecto dominó.」"

msgid "Taiga「Hahaha.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Jajaja.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Ryuuji, don't think even for a second＿that this was your fault. Okay, repeat＿after me. This is me acting of my own」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Ryuuji, no pienses ni por un＿segundo que fue tu culpa. Repite＿conmigo. ¡Soy yo actuando por mi propia」"

msgid "Taiga「volition!」"
msgstr "Taiga「voluntad!」"

msgid "Taiga「......Listen, I know you're probably going＿to toss and turn with worry anyway, so＿when that happens, remember what I」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Escucha, sé que de todas formas＿darás vueltas en la cama preocupado, así＿que cuando pase, recuerda lo que」"

msgid "Taiga「said and calm down.」"
msgstr "Taiga「dije y cálmate.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yasuko was pointing at a familiar＿uniformed figure standing on the side＿of the road and staring blankly at the」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Yasuko señalaba a una figura conocida＿en uniforme, de pie al borde del camino,＿mirando con aire ausente el」"

msgid "Ryuuji「demolition site.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「sitio de la demolición.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Her once-bright expression had faded,＿the sparkle gone from those＿enchanting eyes. Her lips, from which」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Su otrora alegre expresión se había＿apagado, sin brillo ya en aquellos ojos＿cautivadores. Sus labios, de los que」"

msgid "Ryuuji「words once flowed like a stream, no＿longer parted.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「antes brotaban palabras como un＿torrente, ya no se abrían.」"

msgid "Yuri「I'll come and see you every time you＿reach an ending.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Vendré a verte cada vez＿que alcances un final.」"

msgid "Yuri「I want you to reflect on the actions you＿made this time and keep them in mind＿for next time.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Quiero que reflexiones sobre tus＿acciones de esta vez y las tengas＿en cuenta para la próxima.」"

msgid "Yuri「The sunlight's improved in your＿apartment, but what you've lost has＿increased in equal measure...... I'd say」"
msgstr "Yuri「Tu departamento recibe más sol,＿pero lo que perdiste aumentó en＿igual medida...... Diría que」"

msgid "Yuri「things didn't work out for you.」"
msgstr "Yuri「las cosas no te salieron bien.」"

msgid "Yuri「If you'd like to avoid this ending, then＿you must talk to Kushieda-san＿face-to-face and exercise caution in」"
msgstr "Yuri「¡Si quieres evitar este final, debes＿hablar con Kushieda-san cara a cara＿y tener mucho cuidado con」"

msgid "Yuri「your responses!」"
msgstr "Yuri「tus respuestas!」"

msgid "Yuri「Even if the atmosphere turns stormy,＿don't be afraid. Also, maybe you should＿consult the God of Romance in」"
msgstr "Yuri「Aunque el ambiente se ponga tormentoso,＿no tengas miedo. Además, quizá deberías＿consultar con el Dios del Romance」"

msgid "Yuri「earnest.」"
msgstr "Yuri「en serio.」"
